<section class="cs__sec">
  <h2 class="cs__h">Getting it built</h2>
  <p class="cs__p">
    Tokens live in one place and feed both design files and code, so a change is a single pull
    request.
  </p>
  <p class="cs__p">
    Engineers were in the review from the first prototype, so the states, empty screens and error
    cases were agreed before the build started.
  </p>
